  "5506": {
    "inputs": {
      "text": "How the reference pictures align with the target video — Picture 1 (from Shot 1) aligns with the 0.00-second mark of the target video; Picture 2 (from Shot 1) aligns with the 6.00-second mark of the target video.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Static camera locked on the front area of a daytime city bus interior. At the start the scene fully matches <Picture 1>: a young East-Asian woman with long straight dark hair, wearing a white short-sleeve school blouse with a black bow tie and a dark pleated mini skirt, stands facing a white electronic fare validator. Her right hand rests near the card-reading pad. Behind the glass partition the male driver in a light-blue short-sleeve shirt sits at the wheel, looking forward. Yellow vertical handrails, red Chinese banners, posted notices, and the street visible through the large side windows remain exactly as in the reference. The bus is in motion with soft daylight coming through the windows.\n\nThe woman attempts to verify her fare. At 1.00 second the validator emits a clear electronic voice: <d>[English] virgin, Please insert one yuan.</d> She remains in the same standing posture and tries again. At 2.50 seconds the same voice repeats: <d>[English] virgin, Please insert one yuan.</d>\n\nImmediately after the second rejection she lifts the hem of her dark pleated skirt with her left hand, then raises her right leg high and straight in a controlled continuous motion, bringing her exposed genitals close to the illuminated card-reading surface of the validator while her right hand stays near the keypad. Her white knee-high sock and black loafer rise into the upper part of the frame. The leg continues upward until the pose fully matches <Picture 2>.\n\nAt 3.50 seconds the validator plays the acceptance message in a clear electronic voice: <d>[English] Sexual experience: Vaginal 45 times, anal 97 times, oral 165 times; verification passed, free ride.</d> The final frame at 6.00 seconds is identical to <Picture 2>, with the woman still holding the high leg position, skirt lifted, genitals presented to the machine, and all other elements of the bus interior and exterior unchanged.\n\noverall_soundscape: Continuous low rumble of the bus engine and road noise as the vehicle moves through city traffic. Soft fabric rustle and slight skin-contact sound as the woman lifts her skirt and raises her leg. Subtle mechanical beep from the fare validator accompanying each voice prompt. Ambient interior bus atmosphere with distant street sounds filtered through the windows.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A"
    },
    "class_type": "Text Multiline",
    "_meta": {
      "title": "Text Multiline"
    }
  },
